  "details": "It currently spawn in front of you but horizontal with the world. There should be an option like the immersive main menu to have it spawn in front of your eyes and be able to be grabbed and move around.\n\nIf I lay back, I have to brake my neck to look down to be able to see it.\n\nSometime it block the view and I just want to quickly move on the side without open it and close it looking in the other direction.\n\nEvery time one of my controller brake I end up playing one handed. Last time we realize we couldn't manually place a portal with just one left hand.\n\nGive some love to one hand player.",
